Cell["\<\
The ball of radius 3 at the centre of a grid and its boundary, the vertices \
with a neighbour outside. The three measures count 25, 13 and 19.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"54d07e20-c200-4d44-833e-7aca44b1c059"],

